  // ── Getting things done: start, wait, finish, follow up (part170) ───────
  // Waiting for somebody is estar à espera, not esperar alguém — the
  // construction with à is what makes it the waiting rather than the hoping.
  // And the offers to take something on use tratar de and encarregar-se,
  // which is how the work is actually divided up out loud.
