  // ── The office, the ID card and the forms (part189) ─────────────────────
  // The counter has its own words: uma senha is the ticket you pull, uma
  // procuração lets somebody else collect, a cópia autenticada is the
  // certified one, and a fotografia tipo passe is what the machine takes.
  // The German offices keep their names — Bürgerbüro, Landratsamt — since
  // that is the door being described.
