  // ── Ill at home (part192) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
  // Hühnersuppe is a canja, which is the same soup and the same gesture —
  // what somebody makes for you when you are ill. Gute Besserung is as
  // melhoras, an illness is pegada rather than passed on, and being bunged
  // up is being constipado, the word this table has already had to be
  // careful with.
