  // ── Being together (part197) ────────────────────────────────────────────
  // Geborgenheit is o aconchego — the one Portuguese word for being safe and
  // held, and the reason this pack does not have to describe the feeling.
  // Butterflies survive the crossing; a alcunha is the nickname, um elogio
