  // ── Public holidays (part198) ───────────────────────────────────────────
  // Brückentag is a ponte, and Portugal does exactly the same thing with the
  // same word — fazer ponte. Silvester is a passagem de ano, the fireworks
  // are fogo de artifício. Bleigießen has no Portuguese counterpart because
  // the custom has none, so the card describes it rather than borrowing it.
