  // ── Star signs: typical Capricorn, and Mercury is in retrograde (part241) ──
  //
  // The signs take their Portuguese names, and two of them are where Portugal
  // and Brazil part: Aries is Carneiro and Libra is Balança here, not Áries
  // and Libra. Getting those two wrong would put a Brazilian newspaper on the
  // breakfast table.
