  // Smalltalk is conversa de circunstância, the talk you make because someone
  // is standing there. And Sag nie: Das ist doch Unsinn is advice about not
  // being rude, so the Portuguese takes the quotation marks off and keeps the
  // advice: nunca digas que aquilo é um disparate.
