  // to the person behind it — the same reason the Bürgeramt keeps its name.
  //
  // Arbeitsblatt is a ficha de trabalho, which is what a Portuguese teacher
  // hands out, and mit Händen und Füßen is not about hands and feet but about
  // gesticulating until it lands: à força de gestos.
