  // ── Appliances: descaling, the beeping and the fuse that trips (part254) ──
  //
  // Electrics have one right word each in Portugal and no room to improvise.
  // Der Stecker is a ficha, die Steckdose a tomada, die Steckerleiste uma
  // extensão, and der Sicherungskasten o quadro elétrico. A fuse does not fly
  // out — o disjuntor salta.
  //
  // Der Mixer is a liquidificadora, the jug on the counter, not a varinha,
  // which is the stick one; the pack has it howling like a drill, so it is the
  // jug. And der Wertstoffhof stays o ecocentro, as in the recycling pack.
  "der Wasserkocher": "o jarro elétrico",
  "entkalken": "descalcificar",
  "die Mikrowelle": "o micro-ondas",
  "der Kurzschluss": "o curto-circuito",
  "die Steckerleiste": "a extensão",
  "der Mixer": "a liquidificadora",
  "der Toaster": "a torradeira",
  "piepen": "apitar",
  "die Spülmaschine": "a máquina de lavar loiça",
  "der Stecker": "a ficha",
  "die Garantie": "a garantia",
  "kaputtgehen": "avariar",
