  // because that is what the word means on its own, and the sentence beside
  // it shows the pairing Portuguese actually uses.
  //
  // The register is held exactly where German holds it. Nothing here is
  // softened, brightened or explained: Trauer hat kein Tempo stays as short as
  // it is — o luto não tem pressa — and the offer of help stays an offer of
  // one specific thing, because that is the point the pack is making.
