  "Soll ich ihn am Stück lassen oder schneiden?": "Deixo inteiro ou corto?",

  // ── Dance class: the basic step, leading, and the final ball (part332) ──
  //
  // Führen is conduzir — the same verb this table uses for driving a car, and
  // the right one here too, because in Portuguese the leader conduz. Der
  // Tanzpartner is simply o par, and der Abschlussball is o baile de
  // finalistas, which is the same evening at the end of the same course.
  //
  // Discofox keeps its name. It is a German dance floor's default, invented
  // and named there, and Portugal has nothing to call it — which is exactly
  // what the card about every wedding is telling you.
  "die Tanzschule": "a escola de dança",
  "der Tanzkurs": "o curso de dança",
  "der Grundschritt": "o passo básico",
  "der Tanzpartner": "o par",
  "die Drehung": "a volta",
