  // ── Finding a nursery place: the list, the fee, settling in (part341) ───
  //
  // Portuguese splits childcare the same way German does, so the words line
  // up: o infantário is the umbrella, a creche is the under-threes, and as
  // atividades de tempos livres are what happens after school. Die Tagesmutter
  // is uma ama, one word, and die Erzieherin is uma educadora de infância,
  // which is the professional title on her certificate.
