  // ── Cancelling, and giving the real reason (part372) ───────────────────
  //
  // THIS PACK TEACHES THREE CONNECTORS and the Portuguese has to keep them
  // three, or the learner meets porque three times and learns nothing. Weil is
  // porque, denn is pois — the one that follows a main clause and explains it
  // — and nämlich is é que, the Portuguese way of adding the reason after the
  // fact, in the same slot and with the same shrug.
  //
  // É que is not a translation of nämlich, because nämlich has no translation.
  // It is what a Portuguese speaker says at that exact point in that exact
  // sentence: amanhã não posso, é que tenho consulta.
  "verschieben": "adiar",
  "absagen": "desmarcar",
  "die Ausrede": "a desculpa",
  "die Wahrheit": "a verdade",
  "nämlich": "é que",
  "lügen": "mentir",
  "die Lüge": "a mentira",
  "anlügen": "mentir a alguém",
  "Der Grund ist ehrlich gesagt einfach: Ich habe es vergessen.": "Sinceramente, o motivo é simples: esqueci-me.",
