  // ── The flat at the end of the day, first half (part68) ─────────────────
  //
  // These are said between two people who live together, so nothing here can
  // sound written. Ich bin dann mal weg is pronto, então vou andando; wo
  // steckst du denn is onde é que tu te meteste; ich spring unter die Dusche
  // is vou dar um salto ao duche, the same jump in the same idiom.
  //
  // Komm her, ich verhau dich is a threat nobody means. Portuguese has its own
  // and it is shorter: anda cá, que levas. And missing somebody is not a verb
  // at all — tive saudades tuas.
  "Ich telefonier nachher mit meiner Mama.": "Depois ligo à minha mãe.",
  "Ich geh mal kurz runter, bin gleich wieder da.": "Vou só ali abaixo, volto já.",
  "Willst du Stress, oder was?": "Andas à procura de sarilhos, é?",
