  // ── Streaming and making videos (part50) ────────────────────────────────
  //
  // The platform words are the Portuguese interface ones: subscrever and
  // subscritores, a miniatura for the thumbnail, as visualizações for views,
  // and em direto for live. Clipar, raid, lag and emote stay as they are,
  // because a Portuguese chat says them in English too.
  //
  // Der Döner becomes kebab, which is the sign over the shop in Lisbon. Five
  // worst kebabs in town is a video somebody there could actually make; five
  // worst Döner is not.
  "der Kanal": "o canal",
