  // ── Arguing and making up (part30) ──────────────────────────────────────
  //
  // Verletzen is magoar, as this table already has it, and sich vertragen is
  // fazer as pazes — making peace rather than getting along. Ich hab die
  // Schnauze voll is estou farta até aos cabelos: the snout becomes the hair,
  // and the exasperation is identical.
  //
  // Schwamm drüber is águas passadas. Neither language wipes anything; one
  // lets the water go by.
  //
