  // ── Relationship talk: check-ins and hard questions (part32) ────────────
  //
  // Sich auseinanderleben is afastar-se um do outro, and du gehst mir nicht
  // mehr aus dem Kopf is não me sais da cabeça — the head is the same in both,
  // the leaving is the other way round.
  //
  // Red flag, gaslighting and ghosting stay in English, because that is how a
  // Portuguese twenty-year-old says them: isso é uma red flag, ele fez-me
  // ghosting. Translating them would produce a phrase nobody uses to describe
  // the thing the card is about.
