  // ── Talking politics, carefully (part33) ────────────────────────────────
  //
  // Ich halte nichts von ihm is não faço fé nele — Portuguese withholds faith
  // rather than opinion, and it is exactly as dismissive. Da bin ich ganz bei
  // dir is estou inteiramente contigo, and heikel is melindroso, the word for
  // a subject that has to be handled with two hands.
  //
  // Der Kanzler stays o chanceler. Portugal has a prime minister and no
  // chancellor, so the German office keeps the name it holds in the news.
  "die Partei": "o partido",
