  // ── Conspiracies and rabbit holes (part40) ──────────────────────────────
  //
  // Schwurbeln has no Portuguese verb and needed a phrase instead: debitar
  // teorias, which is what somebody does at a dinner table for two hours. Der
  // Aluhut travels intact — o chapéu de alumínio is understood there too.
  //
  // LÜGENPRESSE STAYS GERMAN, and the card is the reason why. It is a term
  // with a history, used by a particular crowd, and the sentence exists to say
  // so. A Portuguese rendering would turn a warning label into a description.
  //
  // Abgedriftet is foi-se abaixo pela toca do coelho, and sich reinsteigern is
  // entranhar-se — the thing gets into him rather than him into it.
