  // ── Abstract nouns (part402) ────────────────────────────────────────────
  //
  // Die Annahme is a suposição and not o pressuposto, which this table already
  // gives to die Voraussetzung — two different things in an argument, and
  // collapsing them would blur the pack's whole point. Die Erkenntnis is a
  // constatação, the thing arrived at, rather than knowledge in general.
  "der Einfluss": "a influência",
