  // ── Describing precisely (part403) ──────────────────────────────────────
  //
  // Adjectives that mark a judgement rather than a quality, and the pairs have
  // to stay apart: zweifelhaft is duvidoso and fragwürdig is questionável;
  // entbehrlich is dispensável and überflüssig is supérfluo; eindeutig is
  // inequívoco and mehrdeutig is ambíguo. Collapsing any pair into one word
  // would cost the pack the distinction it exists to teach.
  //
  // Der Aufwand steht in keinem Verhältnis is não tem nada que ver um com o
  // outro — Portuguese states the disproportion instead of naming it.
  "wesentlich": "essencial",
